urants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ifZ_P8Mj7zVVKhNyKJAQwg","review_id":"L6c9U6ZG_17H-hZaVUOLgQ","date":"2016-08-22T05:40:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9356091618537903,"text_excerpt":"This was my first time at a Waffle House! \"Whaaaaaaaaa?\" Yes, my Cajun boyfriend was just as stunned. Walking in the door we were greeted by all three employees before my backend hit a seat! Talk about welcoming! We sat in a booth closest to the griddle and reviewed the menu so I didn't mess up my hash browns. Here at WH you use a special vocabulary to get your breakfast potatoes just the way you want them. I like mine \"smothered, chunked and covered.\" While perusing the menu you'll notice that the calorie count is listed next to each item. This was extremely helpful! It's way too easy to polish off a diner breakfast, but thanks to the nutrition content I chose to only eat half, and take ..."},{"business_id":"ifZ_P8Mj7zVVKhNyKJAQwg","review_id":"i4IGX7J9VZ5twtQgIZNSzA","date":"2016-07-17T03:41:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9343838095664978,"text_excerpt":"I have been hearing about the opening for years. It was so great to finally pay them a visit and see what it was all about. We had an awesome dining experience. The service was friendly and food was good and fast. Music was rollin and the customers were HAPPY. You can always get the temperature of a business by the staff and customers; both were friendly. The Unit Manager Josh greeted me right away and the others chimed in. Nice symphony. The Master Grill Op Jay worked that grill. Some critics have been harsh stating 'fancy' what? I think this is a very nice Waffle House with potential to be the #1 dining choice in the area. More bistro chairs outside would be perfection. Good Luck Waffle..."},{"business_id":"ifZ_P8Mj7zVVKhNyKJAQwg","review_id":"VcYQ9lyESbycUtJwDgijJQ","date":"2017-11-24T17:48:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9296438097953796,"text_excerpt":"5 Stars for Waffle House? Have you lost your mind? I, in fact, have not. Here are my 5 reasons for my 5 stars. 1. Customer Service - Seriously, the most attentive and friendly staff that I have ever experienced. Did I mention that it was Thanksgiving morning that we were there? A stressful holiday morning and every person was friendly, helpful and conversational. 2. Speedy but not rushed - Food is rushed out quickly and well done. Waiting isn't a thing that anyone enjoys - especially when you are hungry. But even though the food came quickly, I never felt like I was rushed. 3. Food Quality - It's Waffle House, so please know what you are getting. But I also appreciated that everything was..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ifZ_P8Mj7zVVKhNyKJAQwg","photo_id":"nat0YLYK51mFc1L5oJyiXw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nat0YLYK51mFc1L5oJyiXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8711206912994385},{"business_id":"ifZ_P8Mj7zVVKhNyKJAQwg","photo_id":"RW2W0cMdTivR9c5EvKy23w","label":"food","i